    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara is pleased to present Kilmore House and lands to the open market. An impressive Georgian residence standing centrally on 47 acres with excellent road frontage and extensive range of out buildings.\r\n\r\nMuch improved in its entirety over recent years by its present owners and presently an approved organic farm with Bord Bia quality approved status.\r\n\r\nThe main residence is well set back from the road with a sweeping avenue bordered by a selection of lime and chestnut trees leading to a circular shaped lawn with boxed lined teardrop lawn. With excellent layout laid out over three levels, elegantly proportioned with magnificent period features including ornate ceiling cornices, marble mantlepieces, fireplaces, windows to front and side, timber floors, windows etc. There is a spacious secluded patio area, southwest facing, ideal for outside entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe house is surrounded by mature gardens, with a variety of trees shrubs, hedging. There is extensive range of out buildings including main building with double height approximately 27m x 16m. Loose boxes, Hay shed and storage building. There is a large yard and separate service access from road.\r\n\r\nThe lands are laid out in eight divisions. All in grass, well fenced with a significant amount of tree planting in recent years including the planting of 250 native Irish trees in 2018.\r\n\r\nThe main house comprises reception hall with ornate cornicing and glazed doors to inner hall. Drawing room with marble fireplace, ceiling cornice, windows to front and side. Dining room with marble mantlepiece, ceiling cornicing, windows to front and side. The study room has ceiling cornice and window to side.\r\n\r\nOff the inner hall is a bedroom with walk-in-wardrobe, wetroom, door to garden. There is a seperate w.c., whb.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor are five bedrooms. The main with en-suite showerroom, bedroom two with ensuite showerroom and three further bedrooms. There is a seperate showerroom and bathroom at this level.\r\n\r\nAt garden level with separate entrance is a large reception hall with extensive cloak, boot, and shoe storage. Kitchen/dining with extensive range of units, including a 4-oven Aga and a large utility/larder room, family room with solid fuel stove. Opening off the kitchen is a large southwest facing dining area.\r\n\r\n‍The lands are laid out in grass and converted to organic in 2021 with Bord Bia quality assured status. Over recent years the lands have been re-seeded, fenced, drained. A walled garden was restored and extended to include a tunnel and potting shed. Extensive tree planting including Thujia, Walnut, Weeping Ash etc. There is a separate service entrance from road. Wild bird field and other specimen trees, including Elm, Oak, and Cedrus Atlanticus.\r\n\r\nThe outbuildings are extensive and include cattle shed, storage shed and workshop, loose boxes etc.\r\n\r\nThe vegetable garden includes tomatoes,peppers, courgettes, microgreens, beetroot, garlic, broccoli, lettuce, spinach,onion, potatoes etc. Fruits include fig, cherry apples, pear, blackcurrant,gooseberries, strawberries, raspberries, rhubarb. Herbs include mint varieties,thyme, sage, rosemary, oregano, coriander, savoury."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall level\r\nReception Hall\r\nOrnate ceiling cornice and centre rose. Wood flooring, glazed doors to inner hall.\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\nBlack marble mantlepiece with cast iron and tiled insert. Ornate ceiling cornice and centre rose. 2x windows to side, 1 to front.\r\n\r\nDrawing Room\r\nWhite marble fireplace with cast iron insert. Ornate ceiling cornice and centre rose. Alcove cupboard. 2x windows to side, 1 to front. Door to.\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\nCeiling cornice and centre rose.Window to side.\r\n\r\nInner hall\r\nW.C. antique-style wash hand basin. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\nWalk-in wardrobe. Wet room –shower, W.C., wash hand basin, partially tiled. Glazed door and window to garden.\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\nBedroom 1 (rear)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.Tiled shower, W.C., wash hand basin, towel radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (front)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights. 2x windows to side and 1 to front. Tiled shower, W.C., wash hand basin, bidet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (front)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (front)\r\nCeiling cornice. Window to side and front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (rear)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nShower room\r\nShower, W.C., wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nStand-alone cast-iron bath with shower attachments. W.C., wash hand basin. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nGarden Level\r\nReception Hall\r\nBlack and white painted timber floor. Partially panelled walls. Recessed lights. Shoe shelves.\r\n\r\nCloakroom\r\nWood flooring, water cylinder.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfastroom\r\nRange of fitted units, counter & worktop. Belfast sink. Black and white painted timber floor. Recessed lights, glazed doors to patio. Four oven Aga. Access to.\r\n\r\nFamily Room\r\nSolid fuel stove. Wall to wall shelving. Wide plank wood floor. Recessed lights.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nBelfast sink. Plumbed for washing machine. Black and white painted timber floor.Partially tiled.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nLandscaped garden. Range of outhouses and yard. Service entrance. Lands extending to c. 47 acres."
      },
